{"2213340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wind Up", "steam_appid": 2213340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Let's enter the wonderful world of Wind Up! In this haunted castle, you will get suspicious of each other as clockwork dolls. Here you will experience——<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >※Day-Night Cycle</h2>The day is clockwork dolls' home field, while the night is the stage of the imposters. Judge  the situation  to gain advantages for your team.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/e9ba0e636c6451200dfabcef6c5aaea5.poster.avif?t=1673938848\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/e9ba0e636c6451200dfabcef6c5aaea5.webm?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/e9ba0e636c6451200dfabcef6c5aaea5.mp4?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >※Cooperation and Escape</h2>Work together to complete the tasks, find the  exit, and race against time to escape from the castle. Enjoy the sense of accomplishment brought by the teamwork!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/13302ac177268fcc291eda930a1448c8.poster.avif?t=1673938848\" width=702 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/13302ac177268fcc291eda930a1448c8.webm?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/13302ac177268fcc291eda930a1448c8.mp4?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >※Hunt and  Survival</h2>Imposters will show their true appearances and kill clockwork dolls when night falls.  Clockwork dolls need to use all means to  survive. An exciting chase will happen at night!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/0ead075ee1c264536a42f6fbc6a8cf88.poster.avif?t=1673938848\" width=702 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/0ead075ee1c264536a42f6fbc6a8cf88.webm?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/0ead075ee1c264536a42f6fbc6a8cf88.mp4?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >※Hotly Debate</h2>During the day, clockwork dolls have the right to hold a meeting to accuse someone. You can argue fiercely, and persuade others to vote for your rivals and expel them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/df3f103454b79ec486288d0321acb9d3.poster.avif?t=1673938848\" width=702 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/df3f103454b79ec486288d0321acb9d3.webm?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213340/extras/df3f103454b79ec486288d0321acb9d3.mp4?t=1673938848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Let's enter the wonderful world of Wind Up! In this haunted castle, you will get suspicious of each other as clockwork dolls. Here you will experience——<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >※Day-Night Cycle</h2>The day is clockwork dolls' home field, while the night is the stage of the imposters. Judge  the situation  to gain advantages for your team.<br><span cla